{"title":"Hill Giant Titan","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 18 Hill Giant that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/giants-knucklebone\">Giants Knucklebone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-titan\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-titan?lv=18\">Lv 18</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-titan?lv=19\">Lv 19 <span>5</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-titan?lv=20\">Lv 20 <span>4</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-titan?lv=18\" title=\"Pick level 18\"><td><b>18</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>57</td><td>14.4</td><td>900</td><td class=\"muted\">171 · 20.2 · 2,700</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-titan?lv=19\" title=\"Pick level 19\"><td><b>19</b></td><td>61</td><td>15</td><td>950</td><td class=\"muted\">183 · 21 · 2,850</td><td>5</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Ancient%20Battlefield\">Ancient Battlefield</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-titan?lv=20\" title=\"Pick level 20\"><td><b>20</b></td><td>66</td><td>15.5</td><td>1,000</td><td class=\"muted\">198 · 21.7 · 3,000</td><td>4</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Colossus%20Ruins\">Colossus Ruins</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 16 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 16 looted corpses, 100 recorded drops, 3,110 total, 11–115 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/16</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-medium\" title=\"Stamina Potion Medium - in 25% of 16 looted corpses, 4 recorded drops, 4 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/df992b2657b50a24d683.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Medium</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">25% · 4/16</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mana-potion-medium\" title=\"Mana Potion Medium - in 19% of 16 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 3 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/dce7b61a763deccad88f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mana Potion Medium</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">19% · 3/16</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"tome-tailoring-snakeskin\" title=\"Tome Tailoring Snakeskin - in 6% of 16 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/d3c7e7a924558c15a0f9.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Tome Tailoring Snakeskin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">6% · 1/16</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+8 more\">+8 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bearhide-arms\" title=\"Bearhide Arms - in 6% of 16 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/9da825311bcf4ccc4c8a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bearhide Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">6% · 1/16</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Good: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"snakeskin-head\" title=\"Snakeskin Head - in 6% of 16 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a3b5f57d33c5a9dcc2d2.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Snakeskin Head</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">6% · 1/16</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Superior: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"oak-crossbow\" title=\"Oak Crossbow - in 6% of 16 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/0821ca52698bcfad058b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Oak Crossbow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">6% · 1/16</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"giants-knucklebone\" title=\"Giants Knucklebone - in 6% of 16 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/4d86da0826d500792847.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Giants Knucklebone</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">6% · 1/16</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"silver-longsword\" title=\"Silver Longsword - in 6% of 16 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/36c081655f0175a8eac5.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silver Longsword</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">6% · 1/16</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"health-potion-medium\" title=\"Health Potion Medium - in 6% of 16 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/6003f0952eddf298b4c8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Health Potion Medium</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">6% · 1/16</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"leather-arms\" title=\"Leather Arms - in 6% of 16 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/6a0ca98de7c5085cacfe.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Leather Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">6% · 1/16</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Shoddy: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"snakeskin-arms\" title=\"Snakeskin Arms (mage x1) - in 6% of 16 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b67d86c57e0ff1871024.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Snakeskin Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">6% · 1/16</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1 · Enchanted: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" a